{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop between candles, matches and other fuels in this tile based puzzle game; where the goal is simple: <strong>light all candles before your flame flickers out.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350460/extras/40ca699e4c958ec9c4a3396eb86a82bb.poster.avif?t=1770478576\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350460/extras/40ca699e4c958ec9c4a3396eb86a82bb.webm?t=1770478576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350460/extras/40ca699e4c958ec9c4a3396eb86a82bb.mp4?t=1770478576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deduce and discover the rules and mechanics on your own.</strong> Fundamental levels break down mechanics into their core concepts. Intuitive UI and visual cues help you draw the right conclusions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350460/extras/d1fd2c6684f12daef33782b5b73ae9a6.poster.avif?t=1770478576\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350460/extras/d1fd2c6684f12daef33782b5b73ae9a6.webm?t=1770478576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350460/extras/d1fd2c6684f12daef33782b5b73ae9a6.mp4?t=1770478576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hints are progressive, you control how much of the solution is revealed.</strong></p><